# Demo seed

Every feature that adds or changes something a host, a guest, a supplier or a staff user can see updates the demo showcase in the same change.

- Extend `Casazen.Core/Demo/DemoShowcaseCatalog.cs`: add a scenario id to `Scenarios` and template data that exercises the new flow.
- Invented data must stay valid for the real rules (CIN format, required PDFs, safety checklist). Mark it as test (`IsTestData`, `TestDataMarkers`). Do not bypass those checks.
- A new table written by the seed gets a constant in `TestDataEntities`, and reset must delete those rows with the other showcase markers.
- Extend `Casazen.Tests/Unit/Demo/DemoShowcaseTests.cs` so a scenario without template data fails.
- The standing requirement is `.claude/rules/demo-seed.md`.
